{"id":2688,"bodyHtml":"<DIV><div><p>&nbsp; 为深入贯彻国家西部计划战略部署，厚植青年学子家国情怀，经济与管理学院近日以“线下走访+云端座谈”相结合的形式，组织开展西部计划志愿者专项慰问活动，传递学院深切关怀，凝聚服务西部、建功基层的青春力量。</p><p>1月7日，学院党委副书记崔媛带队赴清徐县清源镇、东于镇，实地走访慰问在当地服务的西部计划志愿者，送上慰问物资与诚挚祝福。崔媛一行与志愿者及当地相关负责人座谈交流，细致了解志愿者的岗位职责、工作进展与生活适应情况，认真倾听他们扎根基层的实践感悟、成长收获与所思所盼。</p><p></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=iU8rDRM4CiLl7YLs4QfnlWRL49PolLZYLz-bnzvaL4CDnzC0gihFp2hmCIa0nSy8nSy8L1yPnmn7LNMfUmWknlLYL4NDn7WkMzCDLRMfnRMFMm94U4-sUNMFMNC4Um-Jv2bjo4OeoDX/_I6O_dN0qIbtpYyPLRUDg4-PMzvbgtA8pUbcc&oid=1280026481&tid=1046&nid=21579&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/E4E421F4D2CAB2BEC2396DBB56603AD3/683C27BC/6F3B2\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"600\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=iLm9D8M7-4MRvinsmVfolnVMNV2MmNZZL4UiMzr2oz78o7C0gihFp2hmCIa0oSyiUSyZokybL7Q7LmrkLz-PM7L4UNM7U4f2UmW2L4fRU46FM8QRMRTkMlVFLz-anm7igjfJQ4Oeo4x/qjTjpdAbgDTJQty0LzG8M1yYLzlsoSbw62b8c&oid=1280026481&tid=1046&nid=21579&e=.png\"></p><p><br></p><p>1月9日，学院通过线上方式召开西部计划志愿者慰问座谈会。院党委书记杜苇、党委副书记崔媛、全体辅导员及2025年西部计划志愿者共同参与。杜苇代表学院党委向志愿者们致以亲切问候，高度赞扬他们胸怀“国之大者”、勇赴西部基层的奉献精神与担当品格。她对志愿者们提出三点期望：一要永葆初心，将个人理想融入国家发展和人民需要，在西部沃土中践行青春使命；二要躬身实践，深入基层、向群众学习，将专业知识转化为服务地方的实际能力；三要严于律己，展现经管学子务实进取、甘于奉献的良好风貌，在艰苦磨练中谱写奋斗篇章。</p><p></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=iMNCD8LmAVLNCsLsmCZnNLiLRW7L87ZPo7UYnlM2nm6VMRC0gihFp2hmCIa0L1hRLkyPL1hRn77ZUm-iMN-snNQ7L49iLmLbM7-aLlMfnRQFU8LYLRN4nmfFLNCPUNUJv2bjo4OeoDX/_I6O_dN0qIbtpYyPLRUDg4-PMzvbgtA8pUbcc&oid=1280026481&tid=1046&nid=21579&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/2C012CDA8B256B7FFD3852394B01CAD6/CC2093F0/2F1BD\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"600\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=iozNDZUmNZn7Q7LsmGanR-aLNVRozUZZLN-8Lmr7o7QfL770gihFp2hmCIa0nSyZL1yPM1yDUz9PM4MkLRT2LRlZLzQfoz-sn7CiMlCsUzVFozviUlrfMNrFoRL8LmUJv2bjo4OeoDX/_I6O_dN0qIbtpYyPLRUDg4-PMzvbgtA8pUbcc&oid=1280026481&tid=1046&nid=21579&e=.png\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=iM4nD7M4NYo77iMs4LYLmUDol-DUNQZfolUPUNQ7UNl8Ll70gihFp2hmCIa0USh2MSyiMYyaMNCYLRU4UmVfL4rVMRQ2nzUPL4NaU47aU4rFLR7bM4rfnmWFLzLiU49DgjfJQ4Oeo4x/qjTjpdAbgDTJQty0LzG8M1yYLzlsoSbw62b8c&oid=1280026481&tid=1046&nid=21579&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/AF55706F2043B1A35E46FE41390C10C5/01975AF2/135C86\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"600\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=iU8QDVnzNZoz94nsl-aLmlaLl7DUllZsMRT7MNnVUz7sU4-0gihFp2hmCIa0MSh7okyDLYyaUzfRUlM7MzCDLR62LmTVU8liLmlsoRTkL4rFLNL4nNVkM8nFLzG4nmCaL1baptveo4OeqtXbQDPZ_ShXptQ0g47aMRC0Lm7iM4NJqdbnx&oid=1280026481&tid=1046&nid=21579&e=.png\"></p><p>线上交流环节，志愿者们分享了在西部基层的工作体会与成长心得。他们一致表示，学院的关怀令人倍感温暖，西部服务的经历锤炼了意志、拓宽了视野，深化了对国情民情的认识。今后必将牢记嘱托，脚踏实地、勇担责任，努力将所学所长贡献于西部建设，不负学院培养，以实干实绩为西部发展注入青春动能。</p><p></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=inRUDsolW2L77YUsmW2nRUDn7-bol7ZDLmG4LmGiUzCDnN-0gihFp2hmCIa0M1hfn1yZLShkLNU8LzQRoRM7L8VkLNWfn7V7nzUZU8lZLRnFLl-YLmNDnRnFolUPMR-Jv2bjo4OeoDX/_I6O_dN0qIbtpYyPLRUDg4-PMzvbgtA8pUbcc&oid=1280026481&tid=1046&nid=21579&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/6AF81B2D416C83D3AB2BADADE48CE804/1B2296D4/9D142\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"600\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=iUNVDRozvaLz94LslUsUNCDnzlaL7lZsnmCDMR7bL4AkUm90gihFp2hmCIa0MkyZMkhfnShknmLaolLaUmnkUNlaUmlZLmU8UlM7Mz9Do7MFnzGDLl-iM7rFL4GZnNlDgjfJQ4Oeo4x/qjTjpdAbgDTJQty0LzG8M1yYLzlsoSbw62b8c&oid=1280026481&tid=1046&nid=21579&e=.png\"></p><p>&nbsp; 此次慰问活动不仅搭建起学院与志愿者之间的连心桥，更进一步强化了思想引领与价值塑造。经济与管理学院将持续做好西部计划志愿者的支持与服务工作，加强典型宣传，激励更多青年学子响应党和国家号召，奔赴祖国和人民需要的地方，以“请党放心，强国有我”的铮铮誓言，在新时代赶考路上书写无悔青春。</p><p><br></p></div></DIV>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://jgy.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=iU8rDRM4CiLl7YLs4QfnlWRL49PolLZYLz-bnzvaL4CDnzC0gihFp2hmCIa0nSy8nSy8L1yPnmn7LNMfUmWknlLYL4NDn7WkMzCDLRMfnRMFMm94U4-sUNMFMNC4Um-Jv2bjo4OeoDX/_I6O_dN0qIbtpYyPLRUDg4-PMzvbgtA8pUbcc&oid=1280026481&tid=1046&nid=21579&e=.png"}